  "title": "ZTE MU5001",
  "body": "The ZTE MU5001 seems like an interesting device to support.\r\n\r\n* mainly for Europe (US band coverage is weak)\r\n* 150 GBP used, but there's a large used market so price is going to drop further I hope\r\n* **has 5G**\r\n* preexisting hacks: https://github.com/ZTETool/ZTE-MU5001-HACK (no root though)\r\n\r\nI have no idea if the qualcomm chipset it uses has diag though (it's not MDM* type device)\r\n\r\n",
